ev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":0.0,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":0.0,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":0.0,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.0,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":11.1,"_gate_share_shrink":0.23984423922749265,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.19151589112325568,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.1855,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":100.0,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Autolus Therapeutics plc, a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company, develops T cell therapies for the treatment of cancer and autoimmune diseases in the United Kingdom and internationally. The company offers AUCATZYL, a gene therapy product consisting of autologous T cells that are transduced with a lentiviral vector to express a novel anti-CD19 chimeric antigen receptor. It also develops obe-cel, which is in phase 1 to treat systemic lupus erythematosus, progressive multiple sclerosis, B-NHL and CLL, and CNS lymphoma; obe-cel, which is in phase 2 to treat pediatric B-ALL and lupus nephritis; AUTO1/22 to treat pediatric B-ALL, which is phase 1; AUTO8, which is in phase 1 to treat multiple myeloma and light chain amyloidosis; AUTO4/5, which is in preclinical stage to treat peripheral TCL; AUTO6NG, which is in phase 1 to treat neuroblastoma; and AUTO9, which is in preclinical stage to treat acute myeloid leukemia. The company was incorporated in 2014 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","ceo_bio":"Dr. Christian Martin Itin Ph.D. | CEO & Director | Age 61 | Compensation: $2.7M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 752 people. Revenue per employee of $100K ranks in the bottom quartile among Healthcare peers, with revenue growing 77%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $19K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 27\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["Autolus Therapeutics plc is a small-cap healthcare business with a $311M market cap on $75M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +277% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -52% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $303M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -7.4\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 19% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 19% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (-3.5) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Operating margins 358% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Healthcare peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 114% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Healthcare peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.7% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Analyst Estimates: Here's What Brokers Think Of Autolus Therapeutics plc (NASDAQ:AUTL) After Its Third-Quarter Report","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nasdaq-autl/autolus-therapeutics/news/analyst-estimates-heres-what-brokers-think-of-autolus-therap","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794567972.684,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.028,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Autolus (AUTL) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/autolus-autl-q3-2026-earnings-220457000.html","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794348623.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.128,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Autolus expects full-year 2026 AUCATZYL net product revenue at or above $150M, as BOBCAT data shifts to October 2027 (NASDAQ:AUTL)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4670053-autolus-expects-full-year-